			<attribute key="id" type="int">24</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">We have a file named Heading.js as given below.
export function Heading() {
    return (
        &lt;h1>Welcome to our Site.&lt;/h1>
    )
}

We have another file named MainPage.js, located in the same folder as Heading.js.

Below, we have a few methods to import Heading in MainPage. Which method is correct?
Method 1: import Heading from "Heading.js"
Method 2: import Heading from "./Heading.js"
Method 3: import { Heading } from "Heading.js"
Method 4: import { Heading } from "./Heading.js"</attribute>
